#: ../../source/fun_project/01-fun_Smart_trashcan.rst:18
msgid "Smart trashcan"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fun_project/01-fun_Smart_trashcan.rst:27
msgid "This project revolves around the concept of a smart trash can. The primary aim is to have the trash can's lid automatically open when an object approaches within a set distance (20cm in this case). The functionality is achieved by using an ultrasonic distance sensor paired with a servo motor. The distance between the object and the sensor is continually measured. If the object is close enough, the servo motor is triggered to open the lid."
msgstr ""

